Subject: [PATCH 09/11] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ... & ~Escapable, Iterator.Element is Copyable & Escapable.swift} | 0
 ...lf is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Failure == Never.swift} | 0
 .../{Cardinal.Range+Iterable.swift => Cardinal.Range.swift}       | 0
 .../Iterator/Search/{Search+Swift.Sequence.swift => Search.swift} | 0
 .../{Swift.Sequence+Buffered.swift => Swift.Sequence.swift}       | 0
 5 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Iterator/{Iterable+Buffered.swift => Iterable where Self is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Element is Copyable & Escapable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Iterator/{Iterable+AllSatisfy.swift => Iterable where Self is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Failure == Never.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Iterator/Repetition/{Cardinal.Range+Iterable.swift => Cardinal.Range.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Iterator/Search/{Search+Swift.Sequence.swift => Search.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Iterator/{Swift.Sequence+Buffered.swift => Swift.Sequence.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Iterator/Iterable+Buffered.swift b/Sources/Iterator/Iterable where Self is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Element is Copyable & Escapable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Iterator/Iterable+Buffered.swift
rename to Sources/Iterator/Iterable where Self is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Element is Copyable & Escapable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Iterator/Iterable+AllSatisfy.swift b/Sources/Iterator/Iterable where Self is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Failure == Never.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Iterator/Iterable+AllSatisfy.swift
rename to Sources/Iterator/Iterable where Self is ~Copyable & ~Escapable, Iterator.Failure == Never.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Iterator/Repetition/Cardinal.Range+Iterable.swift b/Sources/Iterator/Repetition/Cardinal.Range.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Iterator/Repetition/Cardinal.Range+Iterable.swift
rename to Sources/Iterator/Repetition/Cardinal.Range.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Iterator/Search/Search+Swift.Sequence.swift b/Sources/Iterator/Search/Search.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Iterator/Search/Search+Swift.Sequence.swift
rename to Sources/Iterator/Search/Search.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Iterator/Swift.Sequence+Buffered.swift b/Sources/Iterator/Swift.Sequence.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Iterator/Swift.Sequence+Buffered.swift
rename to Sources/Iterator/Swift.Sequence.swift
